    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nstarter\n\n### Description\n\nOpening when mini.starter is opened the tabline is hiddent. Is there a way to show tabline always?\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.8.3\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nConfigure starter and tabline\r\n1. `nvim`\r\n2. what do you see? Tabline is hidden!\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nTabline should be  visible after starter open.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nTabline is hidden just after starter open.",
