    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Not showing tabline and showing statusline is by design. This (subjectively) looks better.\r\n\r\nThere is a [`MiniStarterOpened` event](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/63b26037fdf98e0cb72c7f089df18599e6cc79c6/doc/mini-starter.txt#L267-L269) which you can use to reshow tabline. Try adding this after `require('mini.starter').setup()` call:\r\n```lua\r\nvim.cmd('autocmd User MiniStarterOpened set showtabline=2')\r\n```\r\n\r\nDoes this solve your issue?",
            "created_at": "2023-03-24T11:04:37Z",
